## FastAPI quickstart

Start the application locally:

```bash
uv run uvicorn {{ python_package_import_name }}.app.asgi:get_application --factory --reload
```

Health and ready endpoints are mounted under `{{ fastapi_api_prefix }}` when enabled in the template configuration.

Run the production-like container stack locally:

```bash
cp .env.prod.example .env.prod
$EDITOR .env.prod
make prod
```

`make prod` uses `docker compose up --build`, exposes the API on `http://localhost:8000`, and passes `OPENAI_API_KEY` into the container. Exporting `OPENAI_API_TOKEN` also works because the Make target normalizes it to `OPENAI_API_KEY` before Compose starts.
